<title>UK: Die Westhyp adds 50 mln mark to fixed/FRN bond.</title>
<headline>Die Westhyp adds 50 mln mark to fixed/FRN bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue has been increased, lead manager Morgan Stanley AG said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DIE WESTHYP</p>
<p> AMT  * 150 MLN DEM   COUPON  ** 10.00     MATURITY    02.SEP.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 HYBRID    ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE    02.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	REOFFER    99.05</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT/DUES  GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.95	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES    * ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED ON AUGUST 7 FOR 100 MLN DEM</p>
<p>		AT 101.35</p>
<p>	   ** TO YEAR ONE, THEN 17.25 PCT LESS 2 X 6-MONTH LIBOR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
